 "solution": "\\(\\dfrac{11-3\\mathrm{i}}{1+2\\mathrm{i}}=\\dfrac{(11-3\\mathrm{i})(1-2\\mathrm{i})}{(1+2\\mathrm{i})(1-2\\mathrm{i})}=\\dfrac{11-22\\mathrm{i}-3\\mathrm{i}+6\\mathrm{i}^2}{5}\\)。\n\\(=\\dfrac{5-25\\mathrm{i}}{5}=1-5\\mathrm{i}\\)。",
